### ============================================================
### multi-ai-agent — API Test Requests
###
### Works with:
###   - IntelliJ IDEA / WebStorm HTTP Client
###   - VS Code "REST Client" extension
###
### App base URL: http://localhost:8080
### (Spring Boot default port — no server.port override
### in src/main/resources/application.yaml)
###
### NOTE: Replace ORD-1001 / ORD-1002 / ORD-1003 with real
### order_id values from your `orders` table.
### ============================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@endpoint = {{baseUrl}}/api/ai-support
@orderEndpoint = {{baseUrl}}/api/ai-support/order
@workflowEndpoint = {{baseUrl}}/api/ai-support/workflow

### ============================================================
### 1. General AI Chat  (JavaTechieAIAgent — no tools attached)
### ============================================================

### 1.1 Simple greeting
GET {{endpoint}}?message=Hello, who are you?

### 1.2 General knowledge question
GET {{endpoint}}?message=What is LangChain4j?

### 1.3 Coding help
GET {{endpoint}}?message=Give me a one-line summary of Spring Boot

### ============================================================
### 2. Order Support AI  (OrderSupportAIAgent — with tools:
###    getOrderStatus, cancelOrder)
### ============================================================

### 2.1 Ask for order status (triggers getOrderStatus tool)
GET {{orderEndpoint}}?message=What is the status of my order ORD-1001?

### 2.2 Ask for delivery details (triggers getOrderStatus tool)
GET {{orderEndpoint}}?message=When will order ORD-1001 be delivered and where is it right now?

### 2.3 Cancel an order (triggers cancelOrder tool)
GET {{orderEndpoint}}?message=Please cancel my order ORD-1002

### 2.4 Cancel a SHIPPED order (expect error: cannot cancel shipped order)
GET {{orderEndpoint}}?message=I want to cancel order ORD-1003

### 2.5 Order not found (expect error: Order not found)
GET {{orderEndpoint}}?message=What is the status of order ORD-9999?

### 2.6 Non-order question (tools should NOT be invoked)
GET {{orderEndpoint}}?message=What is your return policy?

### ============================================================
### 3. Multi-Agent Workflow  (WorkflowSupportAgent — sequence:
###    OrderAgent -> RefundAgent -> ResponseAgent, with tools
###    getOrderStatus and checkRefundEligibility)
###
### Watch the app console for "=== AGENT START ===" /
### "TOOL CALLED -> ..." / "=== AGENT END ===" log lines.
### ============================================================

### 3.1 Refund request (runs the full Order -> Refund -> Response pipeline)
GET {{workflowEndpoint}}?request=Can I get a refund for my order ORD-1001?

### 3.2 Refund request on a different order
GET {{workflowEndpoint}}?request=I want a refund for order ORD-1002 please

### 3.3 Refund request for an unknown order (expect graceful handling)
GET {{workflowEndpoint}}?request=Please refund my order ORD-9999

### 3.4 Status-style request through the workflow
GET {{workflowEndpoint}}?request=Where is my order ORD-1001 and can it still be refunded?

### ============================================================
### 4. Negative / Edge Cases
### ============================================================

### 4.1 Missing required 'message' param (expect 400 Bad Request)
GET {{endpoint}}

### 4.2 Missing required 'message' param on order endpoint (expect 400)
GET {{orderEndpoint}}

### 4.3 Missing required 'request' param on workflow endpoint (expect 400)
GET {{workflowEndpoint}}

### 4.4 Empty message value
GET {{endpoint}}?message=

### ============================================================
### 5. Handy cURL equivalents (copy/paste into a terminal)
### ============================================================

# General chat:
# curl "http://localhost:8080/api/ai-support?message=Hello"
#
# Order status:
# curl "http://localhost:8080/api/ai-support/order?message=What%20is%20the%20status%20of%20my%20order%20ORD-1001%3F"
#
# Multi-agent workflow:
# curl "http://localhost:8080/api/ai-support/workflow?request=Can%20I%20get%20a%20refund%20for%20my%20order%20ORD-1001%3F"
